OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged following death of
OL,4,Awoman hit by van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old man has been arrested and
OL,7,Fcharged over a road traffic offence
OL,8,Ffollowing a fatal collision in
OL,9,FStranraer in Dumfries and Galloway
OL,10,Fearlier this year.
OL,12,FMargaret Joy Todd was hit by a white
OL,13,FVauxhall Vivaro van at about 10:20 on
OL,14,FSaturday 3 January in Sheuchan Street
OL,15,Fnear the junction with Park Lane.
OL,17,FEmergency services attended and the
OL,18,F85-year-old, known as Joy, was taken to
OL,19,Fhospital where she later died.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
